{{define "content"}}{{if eq .Stage "scheduled"}}<p>{{if .Operator}}An openlog operator scheduled organization <strong>{{.OrgName}}</strong> for deletion.{{else}}An owner scheduled organization <strong>{{.OrgName}}</strong> for deletion.{{end}} Members can no longer sign in to it and its license and API keys stop working now.</p><p>All of its data (members, dashboards, alerts, keys, audit log and telemetry) will be deleted permanently after {{date .PurgeAt}}.{{if not .Operator}} Until then an owner can cancel the deletion under Settings → Profile.{{end}}</p>{{else if eq .Stage "cancelled"}}<p>The deletion of organization <strong>{{.OrgName}}</strong> was cancelled. Members can sign in again and its license keys work again.</p>{{else}}<p>Organization <strong>{{.OrgName}}</strong> and all of its data have been deleted permanently. A deletion certificate without personal data is kept as proof.</p>{{end}}{{end}}
{{define "linkLabel"}}Open settings{{end}}
